Initialize L= as ll
When L-1<k it's impossible to find the kth char in the proceesed string, so return '.'
Due to the lengths in len[N],the 2nd loop , a backward trasversal, 
needs only very simple operations per iteration:
Implementation using C is also presented which does not use the exta array Len[N]
